WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.580
Zorc finally resurrected.

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:34.970
Darkness covered the sky, and the earth trembled.

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:40.570
Its power extended past the memory world to affect the real world.

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:43.360
We need to defeat it.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:48.550
But we're powerless against Zorc's power.

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:52.490
Shada also was defeated.

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:58.510
Legendary Protector
Exodia Resurrects!

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:08.480
Stand your ground!

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:11.890
The palace is straight ahead!

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:13.320
We must stop it!

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:22.880
If only I had a little more Ba, I could summon the White Dragon to destroy it!

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:24.600
Kisara…

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:30.880
Shada…

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:35.780
This is great.

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:38.240
Both worlds are in chaos.

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:39.550
Bakura...

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:46.040
If the Millennium Puzzle was never reassembled and you never resurrected...

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.980
...none of this would've happened.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.750
What an ironic twist of fate.

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:57.740
But thanks to you, I was able to resurrect.

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:01.790
Stop fighting back.  It's pointless.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:06.140
Your destiny is to drown in darkness.

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:10.000
Everything will be covered in darkness.

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:11.660
Destiny…

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:16.950
It's true that my resurrection started everything.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:40.600
Which is why I can’t afford to lose!

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:43.600
Not until I personally end this!

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:47.210
You don't know when to admit defeat.

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:51.770
Let's see how long you can stay confident.

00:03:57.820 --> 00:04:01.480
Pharaoh, Zorc’s power is too great.

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:04.910
If nothing changes, we can't win.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:06.360
But…

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:10.860
Our singular hope...

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:14.900
...lies with the Gods.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:19.900
The three Gods...  However...

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:23.760
Without my Millennium Puzzle, I can’t summon the Gods.

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:26.840
Nor do I have the Ba to summon them.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:31.400
But that’s our only way to defeat Zorc.

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:34.300
Let’s retrieve the Millennium Items.

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:37.880
Isis…

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:43.880
When Zorc resurrected, the Millennium Items' role came to an end.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:47.760
And were scattered into the desert, along with the tablet of the afterlife.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:51.270
I don't know if we'll be able to find them.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.870
Fine!  I’ll go!

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:57.640
No.  You must remain here.

00:04:57.640 --> 00:05:01.660
You motivate all our troops.

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:06.080
My Spiria will find the Millennium Items.

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:08.560
Leave this to me.

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:11.020
Hey!  I'll go too!

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:12.580
Mana…

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.960
I’ll go in place of my master!

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:18.890
Pharaoh...

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:22.330
I'm counting on you, Isis and Mana.

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:23.390
Right.

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:24.760
You can count on us!

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:26.640
Leave from the south.

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:29.200
I’ll draw Zorc’s attention.

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:30.560
Seto…

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:33.360
Understood.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:36.840
I'm counting on you.

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:40.480
Listen!  Fire simultaneously!

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.620
Divert its attention!

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:44.350
Fire!

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:51.850
You fools.

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:57.500
Come forth!  Winged Dragon, Guardian of the Fortress!

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.750
Isis?  Are you okay?

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.180
Yes...  Let’s go.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:12.780
For a weakling, you're entertaining me more than I expected.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:16.730
To help my other self, I refuse to lose!

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.710
Yeah!  Yugi's on the offensive!

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:20.380
Yugi!

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:25.310
Whatever.  Prepare for payback.

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.390
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:30.760
I activate a spell card from my hand.

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:33.150
Spirit Sword of Sealing!

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:38.730
This card removes one monster from the field.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:44.640
Silent Swordsman!

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:50.320
The sealed monster is unaffected by spells, traps and monster effects.

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.560
And it can’t activate its own effects.

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:53.680
Oh no!

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:59.370
I summon Disgraced Mage in attack position.

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:04.360
Disgraced Mage attacks Marshmallon!

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:08.810
Marshmallon’s effect activates!

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:12.540
Marshmallon can't be destroyed in battle!

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:16.990
Too bad.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:22.520
If Marshmallon went to the graveyard, Silent Swordsman would've returned.

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:28.390
Due to Spirit Sword of Sealing, if your monster goes from the field to the graveyard...

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:32.830
...the sealed monster can return to the field.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:38.640
Your own monster's effect ruined your chance.

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:48.460
Quit resisting and die, foolish humans!

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:52.880
Something's weird with Bakura.

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:55.550
He’s been weird from the start!

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:58.400
Dammit!  I wish he'd stop blabbing!

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:00.330
You're right, but...

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:05.420
He seems different than the one who's inside the Millennium Ring.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:08.860
He feels much colder than before.

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:11.280
I end my turn.

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:13.710
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:15.310
Hold up.

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:21.330
Spirit Sword of Sealing has sealed Silent Swordsman's effect.

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:23.680
You can’t raise its attack points.

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:25.440
I know.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:28.930
I summon Blocken in defense position.

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:34.040
Only 300 defense points?

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:36.170
That can't block anything!

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:37.640
I end my turn.

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:43.080
You put a lot of pathetic monsters in your deck.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.570
It's my turn.  I draw!

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:48.170
This will end you.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:51.530
Disgraced Mage, attack Marshmallon!

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:55.950
This is bad!  It has much higher attack points!

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:56.760
Yugi!

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:01.600
You were nothing more than a vessel.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:05.970
Blocken’s effect activates!

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.000
What?

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:15.330
When my monster is attacked, Blocken can take its place!

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:24.370
Nice!  Since a monster went from Yugi’s field to the graveyard...

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:28.980
...Spirit Sword of Sealing’s effect ends, and Silent Swordsman comes back!

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:31.800
No it won't.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:32.550
What?

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:37.310
Disgraced Mage’s effect activates.

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:40.970
When it destroys a monster, that monster returns to the deck.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:44.130
Not the graveyard.

00:09:45.220 --> 00:09:49.080
This combo keeps Spirit Sword of Sealing’s effect from ending!

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:53.350
But Blocken has another effect.

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:59.880
When Blocken leaves the field, it Special Summons Lengard from my deck in attack position.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:05.530
Another low-Level monster.

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:10.330
I set three cards and end my turn.

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:17.570
Millennium Items…

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:18.940
We found them.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:24.330
There they are!

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:27.060
Millennium Scale!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:28.550
Millennium Rod!

00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:30.200
Millennium Ring!

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:31.880
Millennium Puzzle!

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:33.440
Millennium Eye!

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.110
Millennium Key!

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:38.480
I found the Millennium Necklace.

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:40.750
We need to bring them to the Pharaoh quickly!

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:41.820
Yes.

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:08.110
For the sake of my other self, I can’t lose.

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:10.680
My turn!  I draw!

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:14.480
Marshmallon attacks Disgraced Mage!

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:15.440
What?

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:18.930
That’s crazy!  The opponent’s attack points are higher!

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:21.620
So you chose to self-destruct!

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:24.950
Yugi!

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:26.860
What?

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:28.820
He didn't lose life points.

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:32.950
I activated Lengard’s effect.

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:35.960
When my monster takes battle damage...

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:40.000
...this card takes its place and lowers the damage to 0.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:45.910
Since my monster went to the graveyard, Spirit Sword of Sealing’s effect ends.

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:49.850
Silent Swordsman LV4 returns to my field!

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:53.290
I see!  This is what Yugi was after!

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:58.460
Silent Swordsman LV4 attacks Disgraced Mage!

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:04.020
What?

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:05.870
He didn't lose life points.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.260
That was close.

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:11.310
I had to use an effect too.

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:16.040
When Disgraced Mage is destroyed in battle...

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:22.120
...I can return my entire hand and this card to my deck to reduce the damage to 0.

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:23.050
What?

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:25.590
You’re wasting your time.

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:27.920
Whatever you do won't work.

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:30.460
You can’t beat me.

00:12:31.260 --> 00:12:35.330
Stay calm.  Don't let Bakura set the pace.

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:38.720
Calmly analyze the situation and wait.

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:40.780
A chance will come.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:43.920
That’s what my other self would say.

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:46.570
I end my turn!

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:49.580
It's my turn.  I draw!

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:53.290
I activate Pot of Greed from my hand!

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:55.840
I draw two more cards.

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.840
I flip over my set card!

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:01.240
Cursed Twin Dolls!

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:06.620
What’s with those creepy dolls?

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:11.580
Each player chooses a red box or a black box.

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:13.600
One box is cursed.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.070
Yugi, which do you choose?

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.760
One box is cursed...

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:21.510
Okay.

00:13:21.510 --> 00:13:24.190
I choose the red box.

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.860
Then I choose the black box.

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:29.850
The red box’s effect is…

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:33.740
How lucky for you.

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:39.630
Every time a card goes to our graveyards, you gain 200 life points.

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:42.140
Nice!  He picked the right box!

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:45.240
Bakura, what's the black box's effect?

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:48.270
Thank you for cursing me.

00:13:50.190 --> 00:13:54.990
Since I opened the cursed box, my graveyard vanishes.

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:56.830
Your graveyard vanishes?

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.430
What does that mean?

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:07.470
Those are the monsters in the graveyard.

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:09.120
Oh my.

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:13.880
Since my graveyard’s gone, my dead monsters have returned as ghosts.

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:16.890
Creepy!

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:19.200
You sound pathetic!

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:21.660
I hate these things!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:28.220
Don’t worry.  These ghosts are on the field, but they can't attack or defend.

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:31.230
They can't hurt you.

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:35.820
I summon Necro Soldier in defense position.

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:38.270
I end my turn.

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:41.200
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:45.120
Your end draws near.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:52.430
We made it in time!

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:54.520
The palace is still standing!

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:08.700
I thought I sensed the Millennium Items.

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:10.860
How sneaky.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:19.880
Isis!

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:24.120
Get off, Mana.

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:25.790
I’ll be the decoy.

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:27.580
Isis?

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:29.230
I'll fight too!

00:15:29.230 --> 00:15:33.920
You must deliver the Millennium Items to the Pharaoh immediately.

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:35.360
But…

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:40.410
The priests' duty is to protect the Pharaoh.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.800
Mahad would say the same.

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:46.890
And it's Karim and Shada’s last wish as well.

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:48.700
Now go, Mana!

00:15:57.500 --> 00:16:00.350
I use all my remaining Ba.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:07.610
Where did those annoying rats run off to?

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:12.090
You won’t get away.

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:20.540
How dare you!

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:28.380
Karim…  Shada…

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:31.240
I’m sorry.  I failed to protect the Pharaoh.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:32.640
Mahad…

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:41.340
That's...

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:43.520
Isis…

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:44.700
Shimon!

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:48.510
Isis was...

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:56.270
Mana, you can't let her sacrifice be in vain.

00:16:56.270 --> 00:16:59.840
Deliver the Millennium Puzzle to the Pharaoh.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.130
Okay.

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:06.890
Shimon?

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:09.240
I’ll take this.

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:13.160
I'm the first owner of the Millennium Key.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:14.920
Shimon…

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:18.080
Go to the Pharaoh, Mana.

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:19.820
Okay!

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:29.210
Spirit of the palace, will you once again lend your power to this old man?

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:35.160
I release the sacred five sealed in the tablets to gain defense power!

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:53.150
Come out, my ancient spirit!

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:55.080
Exodia!

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:06.380
That's...

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:20.620
That’s Shimon’s Ka.

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:25.200
The legendary divine defender that defeated a thousand-man army in a single night.

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.220
Exodia.

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:33.370
The Ka who once battled at Akamkanon’s side to drive back the invaders.

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:37.340
Your power was too great, so I vowed never to use you again.

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:40.060
And set you as this city's protector.

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:42.540
But now I’m removing your chains!

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:48.160
Go, Exodia!

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:56.940
Good!

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:59.950
This is pointless.  I'm immortal.

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:04.090
What?

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:17.070
If you're immortal, so is Exodia!

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:29.550
I didn't know Shimon’s Ka was this powerful.

00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:30.680
Shimon…

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:40.840
Immortal?

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:47.980
My power comes from the infinite darkness, but your human Ba is finite.

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:50.560
It's not true immortality.

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:57.070
Exodia, incinerate this dark demon with your soul's flame!

00:19:59.180 --> 00:20:02.300
Exodo Flame!

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:07.150
He did it!

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:09.120
Can he defeat Zorc?

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:14.440
Just a little more…

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:19.770
My flame of anger will use my soul as energy to burn it completely.

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:23.700
This flame is too weak to light up the shadows.

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:25.940
I am invincible!

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:28.170
Dark Phenomenon!

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:41.680
Pharaoh, forgive me.

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:45.850
Exodia was…

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:47.220
Shimon...

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:52.170
You humans cannot defeat me.

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:54.280
I am the darkness itself.

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:57.940
Fear darkness.  Darkness will rule you.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:02.140
Humans are powerless against the darkness!

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:06.910
Wrong!  The soul in my body is the light of life!

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:10.310
My soul's light won't succumb to the darkness!

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:12.000
Prince!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:12.680
Mana.

00:21:14.510 --> 00:21:15.420
Take this!

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:17.370
The Millennium Puzzle!

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:22.570
To get this to you, Isis and Shimon were...

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:26.120
Isis and Shimon fell so that I could get this...

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:41.650
Zorc, I will fight alongside the souls of those who died for the light!

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:45.900
I won’t allow this world to be covered in darkness!

00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:13.860
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:29.580
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:30.300 --> 00:22:35.420
Without a goal in mind

00:22:36.740 --> 00:22:43.990
We just step towards our dream

00:22:44.380 --> 00:22:49.630
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:49.820 --> 00:22:58.100
Your eye will find it

00:22:58.460 --> 00:23:03.910
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:04.700 --> 00:23:12.050
Will touch your soul

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:15.310
In a duel

00:23:27.980 --> 00:23:31.990
Even Exodia lost against Zorc!

00:23:31.990 --> 00:23:36.480
But now that he has the Millennium Puzzle, the Pharaoh summons the three gods.

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:40.990
The fierce battle between Zorc and the three gods begins.

00:23:40.990 --> 00:23:43.930
Meanwhile, Yugi duels Yami Bakura.

00:23:43.930 --> 00:23:47.140
The necro twins' effect lays a fearsome trap.

00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:51.570
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Summon!  The Three Gods

00:23:51.570 --> 00:23:53.360
Duel, standby!
